총 8개 주요 공원을 대상으로 야간 조도 측정 및 관련 민원 내용을 수합하였습니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅰ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>1. 점검 개요</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>기간: 2025.06.03.~06.14.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>대상: 구청 등록 주요 도시공원 8개소</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>기준: 보행로 평균 조도 10룩스 이상, 사각지대 여부 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>점검 내용 요약 (공원별 현황)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="None" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978310" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="2"><SIZE Height="2263" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="19590" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="true" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="9" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="2250"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>1</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="10" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="563"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="11" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="16777"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="27" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>가. 해뜰공원</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>평균 조도: 9.5lx</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>문제점: 조도 부족 구역 3곳, 주차장 출입구 어두움</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
→ 민원 건수 2건 (최근 3개월 기준)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="None" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978310" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="2"><SIZE Height="2263" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="19590" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="true" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="9" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="2250"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>2</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="10" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="563"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="11" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="16777"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="27" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>나. 한울어린이공원</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>평균 조도: 11.3lx</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>특징: 전체 조명 LED 교체 완료</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="26"><CHAR>※ 단, 놀이시설 인접 가로등 미작동 보고 1건</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>공통사항 요약</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>대부분 공원 진입부 또는 주변 차도에서 조도 미달</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>주차구역 및 벤치 뒷편 사각지대 빈번</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>민원 유형은 아래와 같음:</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>[조명 고장] 4건</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>[불안 호소] 3건 (야간 귀가 시 이용자 불안감)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>[시설 미확보] 2건 (야간 CCTV 미설치 등)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="26"><CHAR>4. 향후 계획</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>• 해뜰공원 및 별빛쉼터 중심으로
추가 조도 확보를 위한 2차 예산 요청 예정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>• 조도센서 자동 제어 장치 시범 적용 검토 중
• 시민 제안 접수 플랫폼(QR포스터) 확대 운영 계획</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>문의: ○○구 공원녹지과 야간조도 담당 ☎ 02-6677-8899</CHAR></TEXT></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><SCRIPTCODE Type="JScript" Version="1.0"><SCRIPTHEADER/><SCRIPTSOURCE/></SCRIPTCODE></TAIL></HWPML>